## Exception Addendum

### LGPL Dynamic Linking Exception

As a special exception, the copyright holders of FrameForge give you
permission to link FrameForge with the LGPL-licensed libraries listed above
and distribute the resulting combined work under terms of your choice,
provided that:

1. The LGPL libraries are linked dynamically (not statically).
2. You provide a mechanism for users to replace the LGPL libraries with
   modified versions (e.g., by using system package manager or LD_LIBRARY_PATH).
3. You include this exception notice in all copies of FrameForge.
4. You do not remove or alter the LGPL license notices in the LGPL libraries.

This exception applies only to the specific LGPL libraries listed above.
It does not apply to any other GPL-licensed code that may be linked.

